  (d) DAMAGES THAT CANNOT BE CONTRACTUALLY LIMITED UNDER APPLICABLE MANDATORY LAW OF THE CHOSEN JURISDICTION [DOC-006#c009]. Customer grants Vendor a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host, process, and transfer Customer Data solely as necessary to provide the Services [DOC-006#c005]. Intellectual Property & Customer Data Ownership
4.1 **Customer Ownership:** As between the Parties, Customer retains all right, title, and interest in and to Customer Data [DOC-006#c005]. 3.2 **Security Incident Notification to Customer:** In the event of a confirmed Personal Data Breach impacting Customer Data, Vendor shall notify Customer in writing without undue delay, and in any event within forty-eight (48) hours of becoming aware of the incident [DOC-007#c004]. 3.3 **Regulatory Reporting Timelines:** Customer acknowledges that reporting obligations to regulatory authorities (such as the EU 72-hour notice under GDPR Article 33 or relevant state attorneys general under CCPA) remain the legal responsibility of Customer as Controller, assisted by Vendor's incident report [DOC-007#c004].
